# Nightly full crawl of every shop, 02:30 local time.
# Install with:  crontab -e   (adjust the path to your checkout)
#
# Output:  <checkout>/nightly/output/<YYYY-MM-DD>/<shop>.csv
# Log:     <checkout>/nightly/var/nightly-cron.log
#
# run_nightly.sh locates uv itself (cron's PATH is only /usr/bin:/bin, and uv
# lives in ~/.local/bin). If yours is installed somewhere unusual, either set
# UV_BIN_DIR to its directory or add a PATH line above the schedule:
#   PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
#
# ZYTE_API_KEY is optional; set it only if you also want gong_galaxy_com,
# which is not part of the default five.

30 2 * * * cd /path/to/webshop-scraper/nightly && ./run_nightly.sh >> var/nightly-cron.log 2>&1
